+{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linksplatform/Data.Doublets/issues/522","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linksplatform/Data.Doublets","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linksplatform/Data.Doublets/issues/522/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linksplatform/Data.Doublets/issues/522/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linksplatform/Data.Doublets/issues/522/events","html_url":"https://github.com/linksplatform/Data.Doublets/issues/522","id":6010690874,"node_id":"I_kwDOC-RBUc8AAAABZkPdOg","number":522,"title":"SplitMemoryLinks cannot find a link with an internal source and an external target","user":{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-10-24T07:44:02Z","updated_at":"2026-10-28T20:54:32Z","closed_at":"2026-10-28T20:54:32Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Summary\n\n`SplitMemoryLinks<ulong>` of Platform.Data.Doublets 0.18.1, with external\nreferences enabled, cannot find a link that has an internal source and an\nexternal target. `UnitedMemoryLinks<ulong>` with the same constants finds it.\n\n## Minimal reproduction (Platform.Data.Doublets 0.18.1, .NET 10, Linux x86_64)\n\n```csharp\nusing Platform.Data;\nusing Platform.Data.Doublets;\nusing Platform.Data.Doublets.Memory;\nusing Platform.Data.Doublets.Memory.United.Generic;\nusing Platform.Data.Doublets.Memory.Split.Generic;\nusing Platform.Memory;\n\nvar constants = new LinksConstants<ulong>(true);\nvar x = new Hybrid<ulong>(20, isExternal: true).Value;\nforeach (var (name, links) in new (string, ILinks<ulong>)[]\n{\n    (\"united\", new UnitedMemoryLinks<ulong>(new HeapResizableDirectMemory(), UnitedMemoryLinks<ulong>.DefaultLinksSizeStep, constants, IndexTreeType.Default)),\n    (\"split\", new SplitMemoryLinks<ulong>(new HeapResizableDirectMemory(), new HeapResizableDirectMemory(), SplitMemoryLinks<ulong>.DefaultLinksSizeStep, constants)),\n})\n{\n    var a = links.CreatePoint();          // 1 = (1, 1)\n    var b = links.CreateAndUpdate(a, x);  // 2 = (1, x): internal source, external target\n    var found = new List<ulong>();\n    links.Each(l => { found.Add(l![0]); return links.Constants.Continue; }, links.Constants.Any, a, x);\n    Console.WriteLine($\"{name}: created {b} = ({a}, {x}); Each(any, {a}, {x}) -> [{string.Join(\",\", found)}], SearchOrDefault -> {links.SearchOrDefault(a, x)}\");\n}\n```\n\nOutput:\n\n```\nunited: created 2 = (1, 18446744073709551596); Each(any, 1, 18446744073709551596) -> [2], SearchOrDefault -> 2\nsplit: created 2 = (1, 18446744073709551596); Each(any, 1, 18446744073709551596) -> [], SearchOrDefault -> 0\n```\n\nExpected: `split` finds link 2, as `united` does.\n\n## Notes\n\n- With external references only (both source and target external) every\n  store is correct. The random differential check, its log and the commands are in\n  [Comparisons.RedisVSDoublets/experiments/csharp-external-references](https://github.com/linksplatform/Comparisons.RedisVSDoublets/tree/issue-13-f67d791f1225/experiments/csharp-external-references).\n- The Rust `split::Store` of doublets 0.5.0 had a similar defect with external\n  targets; doublets 0.8.0 passes the same check.\n\n## Workaround downstream\n\nThe C# usage benchmarks of `Comparisons.RedisVSDoublets` keep their queue\nnodes as `(next node, raw value)` and therefore use `UnitedMemoryLinks` only.\n","closed_by":{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linksplatform/Data.Doublets/issues/522/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linksplatform/Data.Doublets/issues/522/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}
